ion naturally strips alkalinity (biogenic acidification), which is a critic=
al threat to urchin test (shell) growth. The system requires an automated s=
odium bicarbonate dosing system triggered by pH probes to hold the water st=
rictly at pH 8.1.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-path-to-node=3D"6"><b data=
