e=3D"0">Biogenic Acidification:</b> As noted in the Mugenuni trials (Mos et=
 al., 2015), reduced capacity of culture water to buffer acidification limi=
ts intensive production. The $18,000 annual budget for Sodium Bicarbonate i=
