You have two choices for the facility blueprint:</p><ul data-path-to-node=
=3D"7"><li><p data-path-to-node=3D"7,0,0"><b data-path-to-node=3D"7,0,0" da=
ta-index-in-node=3D"0">Option A (No extra CAPEX):</b> We engineer the plumb=
ing so that the effluent pipe from the Calcium Reactor feeds <i data-path-t=
o-node=3D"7,0,0" data-index-in-node=3D"109">directly into the intake of the=
 Protein Skimmers</i> or the most violently aerated section of the MBBR. Th=
is uses your existing equipment to gas-off that excess CO2 before it reache=
s the main pumps.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=3D"7,1,0"><b data-path-t=
o-node=3D"7,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">Option B (The "Belt and Suspender=
