dex-in-node=3D"66">CO2 Degassing Tower</b> (a tall fiberglass column filled=
 with plastic bio-balls where water trickles down while a fan blows fresh a=
ir up through it) right before the main sump. This adds about $15,000=E2=80=
=93$20,000 to your CAPEX but guarantees absolute pH stability at 27=C2=B0C.=
</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node=3D"8">If you want to keep the system lea=
n, Option A is standard practice. But if you want the absolute safest, most=
 robust system for the investors, we should add a CO2 Degassing Tower.</p><=
